{"id":"0227dc284bb499a1","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-zfc-recursion3-many-one-reduction.md","title":"ZFC Recursion3 Many One Reduction","display":"df-zfc-recursion3-many-one-reduction — ZFC Recursion3 Many One Reduction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursion3-many-one-reduction","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursion3-many-one-reduction","58-df-zfc-recursive-many-one-reduction","58-df-zfc-comp-many-one-reduction"],"display":"df-zfc-recursion3-many-one-reduction — ZFC Recursion3 Many One Reduction","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursion3-many-one-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursion3-many-one-reduction</span><span>58-df-zfc-recursive-many-one-reduction</span><span>58-df-zfc-comp-many-one-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursion3-many-one-reduction — ZFC Recursion3 Many One Reduction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"37437e63af9f668e\" href=\"?note=37437e63af9f668e\" title=\"58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function\">58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in V\">\\(f\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TotalRecursiveFunction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TotalRecursiveFunction}_S\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"37437e63af9f668e\" href=\"?note=37437e63af9f668e\" title=\"58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function\">58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3ManyOneReduction}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcCompManyOneReduction}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3ManyOneReduction}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcCompManyOneReduction}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveManyOneReduction}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveManyOneReduction}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion3\\text{-}many\\text{-}one\\text{-}reduction} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3ManyOneReduction}_S(A,B,f)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\\land B\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TotalRecursiveFunction}_S(f)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(n\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(n)\\in B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion3\\text{-}many\\text{-}one\\text{-}reduction} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3ManyOneReduction}_S(A,B,f)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\\land B\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TotalRecursiveFunction}_S(f)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(n\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(n)\\in B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}many\\text{-}one\\text{-}reduction} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveManyOneReduction}_S(A,B)\\leftrightarrow \\exists f\\;\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3ManyOneReduction}_S(A,B,f)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}many\\text{-}one\\text{-}reduction} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveManyOneReduction}_S(A,B)\\leftrightarrow \\exists f\\;\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3ManyOneReduction}_S(A,B,f)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comp\\text{-}many\\text{-}one\\text{-}reduction\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCompManyOneReduction}_S(f,A,B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3ManyOneReduction}_S(A,B,f)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comp\\text{-}many\\text{-}one\\text{-}reduction\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCompManyOneReduction}_S(f,A,B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3ManyOneReduction}_S(A,B,f)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"37437e63af9f668e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"37437e63af9f668e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TotalRecursiveFunction}_S$ (see [[58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\omega","display":